sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Farmer)
    participant FE as Web UI (Templates/JS)
    participant APP as Flask App
    participant DR as Disease Module
    participant WR as Weight Module
    participant FR as Financial Routes
    participant FC as Financial Calculations
    participant WS as Weather Service
    participant FS as Price Forecast Service (Prophet)
    participant CR as Chatbot Routes
    participant GAI as Gemini API
    participant WAPI as Weather Provider API
    participant MKT as Market Price Sources

    U->>FE: Open website
    FE->>APP: GET /
    APP-->>FE: Home page + module links

    U->>FE: Navigate to Disease Detection
    FE->>APP: GET /disease
    APP-->>FE: Disease page
    U->>FE: Upload chicken image
    FE->>APP: POST /predict_disease (image)
    APP->>DR: Run disease inference
    DR-->>APP: Label + confidence + annotated image
    APP-->>FE: Disease result card

    U->>FE: Navigate to Weight Estimation
    FE->>APP: GET /weight
    APP-->>FE: Weight page
    U->>FE: Upload chicken image
    FE->>APP: POST /predict_weight (image)
    APP->>WR: Run weight model
    WR-->>APP: Estimated weight + annotated image
    APP-->>FE: Weight result card

    U->>FE: Navigate to Startup Planner
    FE->>APP: GET /financial/startup
    APP->>MKT: Get broiler/chick/feed default prices
    MKT-->>APP: Latest market snapshot
    APP-->>FE: Startup form with defaults

    U->>FE: Submit startup inputs
    FE->>APP: POST /financial/startup/calculate
    APP->>FR: startup_calculate()
    FR->>FC: calculate_startup_plan(inputs)
    FC-->>FR: KPIs + cost breakdown
    FR->>FC: build_profit_sensitivity_series()
    FR->>FC: build_mortality_impact_series()
    FC-->>FR: Sensitivity + mortality curves

    FR->>FS: train_and_forecast_prophet()
    FS-->>FR: Price forecast rows + MAE/RMSE
    FR->>WS: build_weather_based_recommendations()
    WS->>WAPI: Fetch forecast weather
    WAPI-->>WS: Temp/humidity daily data
    WS-->>FR: Candidate windows + risk/mortality adjustments

    FR->>FR: Build decision card + startup charts + chatbot context
    FR-->>APP: Render data package
    APP-->>FE: Startup results page

    U->>FE: Navigate to Financial Dashboard
    FE->>APP: GET /financial/dashboard
    APP-->>FE: Dashboard form
    U->>FE: Submit current farm data
    FE->>APP: POST /financial/dashboard/analyze
    APP->>FR: dashboard_analyze()
    FR->>FC: analyze_existing_farm(inputs)
    FC-->>FR: Dashboard KPIs
    FR->>FS: train_and_forecast_prophet()
    FS-->>FR: Forecast for decision curves
    FR->>FR: Build projections + scenario charts + chatbot context
    APP-->>FE: Dashboard analysis page

    U->>FE: Ask chatbot question
    FE->>APP: POST /api/chat (message + page_context + history)
    APP->>CR: chat()
    CR->>GAI: generateContent(system prompt + context)
    GAI-->>CR: Natural-language reply
    CR-->>APP: Chatbot answer
    APP-->>FE: Show answer (AR/EN based on context)
